msgstr "来源：卫星、有线、地面或网络流、DiSEqC 端口，或卫星、网络、导入文件或 IPTV 列表"

msgid "LinDVB channel file (.json): everything, with the favourites lists"
msgstr "LinDVB 频道文件 (.json)：全部内容，含收藏列表"

msgid "M3U playlist (.m3u): internet channels and DVB-I streams"
msgstr "M3U 播放列表 (.m3u)：网络频道和 DVB-I 流"

msgid "dvbv5 channel file (.conf): tuner channels"
msgstr "dvbv5 频道文件 (.conf)：调谐器频道"

msgid "CSV table (.csv): every channel"
msgstr "CSV 表格 (.csv)：所有频道"

msgid "Export Channel List"
msgstr "导出频道列表"

msgid "TV channels only"
msgstr "仅电视频道"

msgid "Radio stations only"
msgstr "仅广播电台"

msgid "The channels shown in the list ({n})"
msgstr "列表中显示的频道 ({n})"

msgid "Save…"
msgstr "保存…"

msgid "There are no channels to export."
msgstr "没有可导出的频道。"

msgid "None of these {total} channels can be stored in this format; internet channels go into M3U, tuner channels into dvbv5, every channel into CSV or the LinDVB channel file."
msgstr "这 {total} 个频道都无法以此格式保存；网络频道可存为 M3U，调谐器频道可存为 dvbv5，所有频道可存为 CSV 或 LinDVB 频道文件。"

msgid "{n} of {total} channels will be saved; the other {skipped} cannot be stored in this format."
msgstr "将保存 {n} / {total} 个频道；其余 {skipped} 个无法以此格式保存。"

msgid "{n} channels will be saved."
msgstr "将保存 {n} 个频道。"

msgid "Could not save {name}"
msgstr "无法保存 {name}"

msgid "{n} channels exported to {path}"
msgstr "已将 {n} 个频道导出到 {path}"

msgid "Import channel list (LinDVB .json, dvbv5, VDR, lamedb, M3U, CSV, DVBViewer .ini)"
msgstr "导入频道列表（LinDVB .json、dvbv5、VDR、lamedb、M3U、CSV、DVBViewer .ini）"

msgid "Server (host:9981)"
msgstr "服务器 (host:9981)"

msgid "The channels of a Tvheadend server, with its channel tags as groups and its programme guide. Leave user name and password empty when the server does not ask for them. The password is kept in the LinDVB settings."
msgstr "Tvheadend 服务器的频道，以其频道标签作为分组，并包含其节目指南。如果服务器不要求，用户名和密码请留空。密码保存在 LinDVB 设置中。"

msgid "Tvheadend: {n} programmes loaded"
msgstr "Tvheadend：已加载 {n} 个节目"

msgid "Hardware Tuners"
msgstr "硬件调谐器"

msgid "No hardware tuner found."
msgstr "未找到硬件调谐器。"

msgid "The Snap package may only use the tuners once its DVB interface is connected: run “sudo snap connect lindvb:dvb” and start LinDVB again."
msgstr "Snap 软件包只有在其 DVB 接口连接后才能使用调谐器：请运行“sudo snap connect lindvb:dvb”并重新启动 LinDVB。"

msgid "Linux has not set up a DVB device (/dev/dvb is missing). The driver or the firmware of the tuner is probably missing; “dmesg | grep -i dvb” shows what the kernel reports."
msgstr "Linux 尚未设置 DVB 设备（缺少 /dev/dvb）。可能缺少调谐器的驱动程序或固件；“dmesg | grep -i dvb”会显示内核报告的内容。"

msgid "Connect a tuner and open the preferences again."
msgstr "请连接调谐器并重新打开设置。"

msgid "{n} tuners found in this computer."
msgstr "在此计算机中找到 {n} 个调谐器。"

msgid "1 tuner found in this computer."
msgstr "在此计算机中找到 1 个调谐器。"

msgid "Tuner {n}: {name}"
msgstr "调谐器 {n}：{name}"

msgid "Internet stream {host}"
msgstr "网络流 {host}"

msgid "the server ended the stream"
msgstr "服务器结束了流"

msgid "{host}: {reason} – connecting again in {s} s"
msgstr "{host}：{reason} – {s} 秒后重新连接"

msgid "{host}: connected again"
msgstr "{host}：已重新连接"

msgid "could not open the stream"
msgstr "无法打开流"

msgid "{name}: playing the stream directly, without timeshift ({reason})"
msgstr "{name}：直接播放流，不使用时移（{reason}）"

msgid "Connection lost ({reason}) – connecting again in {s} s"
msgstr "连接中断（{reason}）– {s} 秒后重新连接"

msgid "Connected again"
msgstr "已重新连接"

msgid "{name} has no catch-up"
msgstr "{name} 没有回看功能"

msgid "Catch-up: {title} ({name}, {time})"
msgstr "回看：{title}（{name}，{time}）"

msgid "Timeshift for internet channels"
msgstr "网络频道的时移"

msgid "Internet TV channels go through the timeshift buffer like a tuner's: pause, jump back and keep the buffer as a recording. Radio streams play directly."
msgstr "网络电视频道像调谐器频道一样经过时移缓冲区：可暂停、回退并将缓冲区保存为录像。广播流直接播放。"

msgid "Quality of HLS / DASH streams"
msgstr "HLS / DASH 流的质量"

msgid "Automatic (follows the connection)"
msgstr "自动（随连接调整）"

msgid "Always the best"
msgstr "始终最佳"

msgid "Automatic switches to a lower quality when the connection gets slow; the buffer keeps what arrived. Always the best looks the same all the time, but stops to wait on a slow connection."
msgstr "连接变慢时，自动模式会切换到较低画质；缓冲区会保留已收到的内容。“始终最佳”画质始终一致，但在连接较慢时会停下来等待。"

msgid "Reconnect internet streams"
msgstr "重新连接网络流"

msgid "When the connection of an internet or Tvheadend channel breaks, it is opened again after a few seconds, for up to three minutes."
msgstr "网络或 Tvheadend 频道的连接中断时，会在几秒后重新打开，最长持续三分钟。"

msgid "Watch from the Start"
msgstr "从头观看"

msgid "Plays the programme from its start from the provider's archive (catch-up)"
msgstr "从运营商的存档中从头播放节目（回看）"

msgid "HLS and DASH internet streams are recorded with one audio track (the preferred language when it is offered)."
msgstr "HLS 和 DASH 网络流以一条音轨录制（如有提供，则为首选语言）。"

msgid "margin"
msgstr "余量"

msgid "pixel"
msgstr "像素"

msgid "TV"
msgstr "电视"

msgid "Filter"
msgstr "筛选"

msgid "Source or group"
msgstr "来源或分组"

msgid "Favourites list"
msgstr "收藏列表"

msgid "For channels whose type was guessed wrong, e.g. internet streams or imported lists"
msgstr "适用于类型判断错误的频道，例如网络流或导入的列表"

msgid "Sort by number to move channels"
msgstr "请按编号排序以移动频道"

msgid "Move up in the channel list (Alt+Up)"
msgstr "在频道列表中上移 (Alt+Up)"

msgid "Move down in the channel list (Alt+Down)"
msgstr "在频道列表中下移 (Alt+Down)"

msgid "Add to the favourites list"
msgstr "添加到收藏列表"

msgid "Remove from the favourites list"
msgstr "从收藏列表中移除"

msgid "Move up in the favourites list (Alt+Up)"
msgstr "在收藏列表中上移 (Alt+Up)"

msgid "Move down in the favourites list (Alt+Down)"
msgstr "在收藏列表中下移 (Alt+Down)"

msgid "Empty. Drag channels here or use the arrow button."
msgstr "空。请将频道拖到此处或使用箭头按钮。"

msgid "No favourites list yet. Use the star of a channel to make one."
msgstr "还没有收藏列表。使用频道的星标即可创建。"

msgid "Sort the channel list"
msgstr "排序频道列表"

msgid "By group and name"
msgstr "按分组和名称"

msgid "By the numbers of the DVB-I list"
msgstr "按 DVB-I 列表的编号"

msgid "{n} channels · drag to reorder"
msgstr "{n} 个频道 · 拖动以重新排序"

msgid "Shown as the source in the channel list filter. Empty: the name the list gives itself."
msgstr "在频道列表筛选器中显示为来源。留空：列表自身的名称。"

msgid "The name the list gives itself"
msgstr "列表自身的名称"

msgid "Name in the channel list"
msgstr "频道列表中的名称"
